      "pattern": "drift",
      "direction": "increase",
      "magnitude": "A/E rose from ~0.96 to 1.12 (+0.16), dropping to 0.93 in 2024",
      "confidence": 0.80,
      "evidence": [
        "ae_ip_by_year.csv: consistent upward move from sub-1.0 levels to 1.10-1.12 in 2022-23; smoothed 3y MA R2=0.93, gradient +0.019/yr; excursion score 9.9; 2024 reversion noted as part of trend window"
      ],
      "recommended_action": "Review IP onset rates and termination/recovery experience by diagnosis and duration; assess impact of macroeconomic conditions or claims handling changes on IP claim duration; update pricing/valuation trend assumptions if the experience shift is deemed persistent."
    }
  ]
}

